        "ggGQ2iBSNsm_text": "<p>Dr. Claire Thompson</p>",
        "ggHmb9yEBaW_text": "<p>Kevin</p>",
        "ggJJhNPvdcfJC_text": "<p>We Aim To Help 1 Billion Women Conquer Menopause—So They Can Finally Feel Like Themselves Again</p>",
        "ggJWHTvsQ3B_text": "Elizabeth Ross",
        "ggM57J-QxtT_text": "<p>Dr. Ross applies decades of clinical experience to fine-tune MenoMate's synergistic blend. \"I've witnessed firsthand how critical natural tendon support becomes during hormonal transitions, especially for maintaining comfortable side-sleeping and daily mobility.</p>",
        "ggSMsMeEKgb_text": "<p>Together, our diverse expertise blends into<strong> one mission</strong>: to give you real,<strong> life-changing relief</strong> from menopause so you can reclaim your comfort, confidence, and joy every single day.</p>",
        "ggTWmJSCODw_text": "<p>Kevin</p>",
        "ggTnzx1Lt6k_text": "Founder & Biohacking Enthusiast",
        "ggVGKS8U0Ov_text": "<p>Founder &amp; Biohacking Enthusiast</p>",
