        "ggh7sbMJ4ab_text": "Founder & Biohacking Enthusiast",
        "ggi1Ys6RGq0_text": "Founder & Biohacking Enthusiast",
        "ggi9sRuURjw_text": "<p>Kevin</p>",
        "gglHP47PWP__text": "<p>Motivated by his wife's struggle with debilitating hip pain, Kevin committed to finding natural, research-backed alternatives. \"Watching my wife unable to sleep comfortably for months was heartbreaking. Creating MenoMate became my personal mission—helping women maintain their active lifestyles throughout menopause.</p>",
