        "ggmek_OkGAD_text": "OB/GYN - 25+ Years in Women's Health",
        "ggnVxyizYzO_text": "<p>ND- Women's Hormone Expert</p>",
        "ggnhcgAYMUG_text": "<p>Motivated by his wife's struggle with debilitating hip pain, Kevin committed to finding natural, research-backed alternatives. \"Watching my wife unable to sleep comfortably for months was heartbreaking. Creating MenoMate became my personal mission—helping women maintain their active lifestyles throughout menopause.</p>",
        "ggo86DyUKEj_text": "BSc-Lead Nutrition Scientist",
