        "ggwtEKJYfTz_text": "OB/GYN - 25+ Years in Women's Health",
        "ggxnhJNQlzj_text": "Founder & Biohacking Enthusiast",
        "ggybK8gcXTm_text": "<p>BSc-Lead Nutrition Scientist</p>",
        "ggykfRAWJLK_text": "Rachel Nguyen",
        "grmBWWhzjPHPx_text": "Dr. Claire Thompson",
        "gsyBRQiHNgkYE_text": "<p>Rachel leverages her extensive knowledge of bioactive plant compounds to optimize every component in MenoMate. \"Through rigorous clinical testing, we've ensured each ingredient delivers measurable improvements in tendon resilience and joint comfort—without resorting to synthetic compounds or short-term fixes.\"</p>"
