    "gp_section_565251374938326027": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "1a61b17089d087a97ad752292e4f97792350da2b35afae6a8b3508254a5c33ca_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gVNP3mJVGmW_text": "<p>Yes, MenoMate is completely hormone-free. It does not contain any estrogen or synthetic hormones. Instead, MenoMate uses 100% natural, high-quality ingredients like probiotics, turmeric, and black cohosh to support your body during menopause, helping to manage symptoms without relying on hormones. Always consult with your doctor if you have specific health concerns or are taking medications before starting any new supplement.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>",
        "gg-KthtnTFT_text": "<p>We don’t recommend it. MenoMate uses <strong>EMBO Caps®</strong> — a special plant-based capsule that helps deliver the ingredients right where your body can absorb them best. Opening them could reduce their effectiveness, so you’ll get the most benefits by taking them whole.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>",
        "gg0JbU6NUk9_text": "<p>MenoMate is made with high-quality, natural ingredients and is free from stimulants, so it’s safe for long-term use. Side effects are rare, but some women might experience mild bloating or digestive changes in the first few days as the probiotics start working. This is normal and should go away quickly. If you have any discomfort, stop taking MenoMate and talk to your doctor. If you are pregnant, breastfeeding, or on medication, consult your doctor before starting MenoMate. Taking 2 capsules per day as recommended helps minimize side effects and gives you the best results.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>",
        "gg36WI1qhWS_text": "<p>Yes! MenoMate is suitable for all these diets. It can support digestion, improve nutrient absorption, and promote overall wellness. Many women on these diets have experienced extra benefits, such as better digestion, weight management, improved mood, and more energy throughout the day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>",
