        "ggz5bk3wfSY_text": "<p>MenoMate is protected by our <strong>90-Day 100% Money-Back Guarantee</strong>. If you don’t see or feel a difference in your menopausal symptoms, reach out within 90 days for a<strong> refund—no questions asked</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"
